-- Per class token: its spellbook tabs in order, its trainers and its spells.
-- A trainer is { npc = NPC ID, name, side (omitted: serves both sides), tab
-- (only for one who teaches a single tab's spells: the mage's portal
-- trainers) }, grouped by map. A spell is { tab, ranks = { { spell ID, level,
-- cost in copper }, ... } }. A rank 1 the trainers don't teach is { spell ID }
-- alone, with first = "quest" or "talent" saying where it comes from;
-- side = "Alliance" or "Horde" marks a spell only that side's trainers teach.
-- A racial spell (tab "RACIAL") has race = the game's race ID and that race's side.
-- A rank whose price isn't known is { spell ID, level } alone: a spell no Classic trainer
-- taught (new in WoW: Forever, or the priest's Fear Ward), or one Forever moved
-- (scraper/classes/changes.json).
